        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP10225, Solid Brass Modern Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull can be used on amy door where a flush installation is required like on sliding pocket doors.  The Deltana FP10225 is available in 10 finishes including satin nickel, satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP10225-specifcations.gif?v=1704354538\" width=\"600\" height=\"215\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP10225 10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/4-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp40\"><b>4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/7-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp7178\"><b>7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP10225 Large 10 Inch Pocket Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening Height: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening  Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Finger Lip: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw:  #3 x 5/8\" wood screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP10225-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262322\"><b>Deltana FP10225 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull | Deltana FP10225",
                "description": "Deltana FP10225, 10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull - The 10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull can be used on amy door where a flush installation is required like on sliding pocket doors.  The Deltana FP10225 is available in 10 finishes including satin nickel, satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome.",
